  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Modernizacin Poder Legislativo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Congress Modernization</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM&apos;S PRINCIPAL OBJECTIVE IS TO STRENGTHEN THE CONGRESS&apos;S TECHNICAL CAPABILITIES AND EFFICIENCY. THE SPECIFIC OBJECTIVES ARE TO: (I) IMPROVE THE CONGRESS&apos;S LEGISLATIVE, REPRESENTATION AND CONTROL FUNCTIONS; AND (II) TO MODERNIZE ITS INFORMATION-TECHNOLOGY CAPACITY. THE FIRST COMPONENT INCLUDES TECHNICAL ADVISORY AND TRAINING; LEGISLATIVE INFORMATION SYSTEMS; AND PUBLIC OUTREACH ACTIVITIES. THE SECOND COMPONENT INCLUDES INFORMATION TECHNOLOGY AND TRAINING.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
